flowchart TD
    IN[remote change] --> D{diverged from local?}
    D -->|no / causal| FF[fast-forward apply]
    D -->|concurrent| POL{policy}
    POL -->|LWW| WIN[higher version wins]
    POL -->|field merge| M3[three-way merge]
    POL -->|CRDT| MC[commutative merge]
    POL -->|user| ASK[prompt -> choice]
    WIN --> CONV[converged state]
    M3 --> CONV
    MC --> CONV
    ASK --> CONV
